WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.299
Day 7. Your child finds the split.

2
00:00:02.749 --> 00:00:09.561
Watch first. The first one on the page is done for you: show it, do the next one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:10.061 --> 00:00:14.741
Today the long words on job one have no dashed line. Your child draws it.

4
00:00:15.191 --> 00:00:19.674
Find the two vowels first. Then split between the letters that stand between them.

5
00:00:26.308 --> 00:00:27.465
The word is sunlit.

6
00:00:28.365 --> 00:00:32.921
The words to say to your child are in the yellow box at the top. Read them out.

7
00:00:33.371 --> 00:00:39.470
Do the first row of job one together. Draw the line, then read. Your child does the second row.

8
00:00:39.920 --> 00:00:43.953
If a word goes wrong, do not say it. Say the same words every time.

9
00:00:44.403 --> 00:00:49.131
Cover the second beat with a finger. Read the first one. Then uncover the rest.

10
00:00:49.931 --> 00:00:55.637
Job two is for your child alone. Read each word first. Then draw a line to its picture.

11
00:00:56.087 --> 00:01:00.427
The picture comes after the word. So the picture is the check, and not the clue.

12
00:01:00.877 --> 00:01:04.340
At the end, your child reads three words to you. Mark each one.
